[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764784230","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104817#issuecomment-2764784230","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104817","id":2764784230,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ky0Jm","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-30T22:48:30Z","updated_at":"2025-03-30T22:50:16Z","body":"Believe it or not, but there is actually a very similar PR open already: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104264\r\n\r\nIt seems the two of you have made some different choices in the details though :)\r\ncc @YYF233333","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764784230/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764787181","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104817#issuecomment-2764787181","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104817","id":2764787181,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ky03t","user":{"login":"CedNaru","id":31470327,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNDcwMzI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31470327?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru","html_url":"https://github.com/CedNaru","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-30T22:55:48Z","updated_at":"2025-03-30T23:44:18Z","body":"Ho right. I tried to check if something similar was done, but I guess I didn't search the right keywords.\r\n\r\nThe main difference is that I also removed the StringName from the virtual call.\r\n\r\nBut I realize I made a mistake. I didn't consider the mentioned  case of :\r\n```\r\ninvalid: initialized == true, ptr == nullptr\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf there is an extension set, and it doesn't implement a specific virtual method, then the pointer will be forever null, and the branch will be tested every single call so what I did is actually not good on that matter.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764787181/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764824010","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104817#issuecomment-2764824010","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104817","id":2764824010,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ky93K","user":{"login":"CedNaru","id":31470327,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNDcwMzI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31470327?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru","html_url":"https://github.com/CedNaru","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T00:13:43Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T08:14:24Z","body":"Okay, I fixed this part.\r\nI reused the idea of having -1 as the invalid value. But instead of casting, I used a union with 2 fields to clearly show the different intent. \r\nCode 0 (and so pointer being null) --> Uninitialized\r\nCode -1  --> Invalid (no pointer found)\r\nOther --> Valid pointer\r\n\r\nIt should work as intended now. Pick whatever implementation you prefer.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764824010/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2766143773","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104817#issuecomment-2766143773","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104817","id":2766143773,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k4AEd","user":{"login":"CedNaru","id":31470327,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNDcwMzI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31470327?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru","html_url":"https://github.com/CedNaru","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T12:56:46Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T13:10:23Z","body":"I made an additional change to the ifs layout. Now the call to the extension void pointer is made inside the `if(extension)`. That way we don't have to check if the pointer is initialized, we know it is because it's done in the same branch.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2766143773/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2766425182","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104817#issuecomment-2766425182","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104817","id":2766425182,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k5Exe","user":{"login":"aaronp64","id":136198872,"node_id":"U_kgDOCB462A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136198872?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronp64","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T14:29:32Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T14:29:32Z","body":"In addition to the reduced memory, this also speeds up creation/deletion of `Nodes`, since the same `StringNames` can be reused.  Tested creating/deleting with gdscript below:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n\tvar a := []\r\n\t\r\n\tvar start := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tfor i in 100000:\r\n\t\ta.push_back(Node3D.new())\r\n\tfor i in 100000:\r\n\t\ta[i].free()\r\n\tvar end := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tprint(\"No tree: %dms\" % [end - start])\r\n\t\r\n\tstart = Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tfor i in 100000:\r\n\t\tadd_child(Node3D.new())\r\n\tfor child in get_children():\r\n\t\tchild.free()\r\n\tend = Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tprint(\"With tree: %dms\" % [end - start])\r\n```\r\n\r\nold:\r\n```\r\nNo tree: 196ms\r\nWith tree: 431ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nnew:\r\n```\r\nNo tree: 133ms\r\nWith tree: 363ms\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2766425182/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2766723715","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104817#issuecomment-2766723715","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104817","id":2766723715,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k6NqD","user":{"login":"CedNaru","id":31470327,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNDcwMzI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31470327?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru","html_url":"https://github.com/CedNaru","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T16:12:50Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T16:12:50Z","body":"Another approach tried.\r\nThis time, a global const pointer is declared in gdvirtual.inc.gen that takes the address of a dummy variable. Instead of using a magic number -1, this dummy pointer is used instead.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2766723715/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"htt